# NOTE on what is deliberately NOT ignored:
#   data/raw/        the two UCI CSV files are committed, so the project is
#                    reproducible without a download (they are ~150 KB total)
#   models/*.pkl     committed so `streamlit run app.py` works immediately
#                    after cloning, without first running the training script
#   results/         committed because the README and report quote these exact
#                    numbers; keeping them in version control is what makes the
#                    claim "these are the real figures" checkable
